<!-- ══ Pass-25 (#4.3: Transfers — ACTIVE sub-tab) ═══════════════════════
     The Active pill previously drew the same circular-arrows refresh
     glyph as the Connected Devices Refresh button (and the server card's
     start state) — three near-identical controls, broken apart this pass.
     "Active" is a LIVE-ACTIVITY concept, and the activity pulse line says
     exactly that at a glance: a heartbeat trace with its baseline, in the
     app's stroke language (1.65dp round caps, 24dp grid) so it reads as
     one designed set beside Received's download arrow (ic_download) and
     Sent's history glyph (ic_history). Pill selection styling, badge and
     click behavior are unchanged. -->
